<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65236" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰτεύ-ω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σω</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			14.110
		</span></i>: aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμάτευσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					5.24
				</span></i>
			:—=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστεύω</span>, abs.,
				<i>seek, search</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγὺς ἀνήρ, οὐ
				δηθὰ ματεύσομεν</span> Il.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκοθεν μάτευε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					3.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				211
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.
			acc., <i>seek for, search after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματεύει ὧν ἀνευρήσει φόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1094
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				219
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1210
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατον εὑρέμεν μ. ἐλάφῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					30
				</span></i>
			 (cj.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c.
				inf., <i>seek, strive to</i> do, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ματεύσῃ θεὸς γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					5.24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1052
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> c. acc. loci,
				<i>search, explore</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματεύει ἄλλος ἀλλοίαν κέλευθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					9.35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					663
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χωρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					21.65
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
